  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - Air Quality Management Program, through Government of China (P.R.C.)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The China Air Quality Management Program, developed in cooperation with the U.S. Environmental Protection Agency (EPA), is assisting China&apos;s Ministry of Environmental Protection (MEP) to meet their goals for reducing air pollution across the country through developing an air quality management plan based on U.S. best practices and technologies. The project is also disseminating information on U.S. clean air technologies in this sector through a series of workshops tied to the air quality management plan development.</narrative>
  </description>
